- template: background numbers; why-shot and outcome-shot required; real standard procedure steps, never invented, never call a cut thing protected; procedure shown on the hero via stage param, no second diagram of the subject; hero centre y 800-950; labels only parts, steps, key numbers; silhouette built as smooth bezier path from a written outline
